,"+                () -> defaultingMapper.readValue(json2, ObjectWrapper.class));","+        verifyException(e, \"Could not resolve type id 'java.sql.Time'\");","+        verifyException(e, \"as a subtype of\");","+    }","+","+    // [databind#6350]: `OptionalInt`, `OptionalLong` and `OptionalDouble` also","+    // have explicit deserializers","+    @Test","+    public void withJdkPrimitiveOptionalsOk() throws Exception","+    {","+        final ObjectMapper defaultingMapper = jsonMapperBuilder()","+                .activateDefaultTyping(BasicPolymorphicTypeValidator.builder()","+                        .allowSubTypesWithExplicitDeserializer()","+                        .build(),","+                        DefaultTyping.NON_FINAL)","+                .build();","+","+        for (Object value : new Object[] {","+                OptionalInt.of(3), OptionalLong.of(42L), OptionalDouble.of(0.5) }) {","+            String json = defaultingMapper.writeValueAsString(new ObjectWrapper(value));","+            ObjectWrapper result = defaultingMapper.readValue(json, ObjectWrapper.class);","+            assertEquals(value, result.value);","+        }","+    }","+","+    // `JsonNode` types (and `TokenBuffer`) have explicit deserializers too","+    @Test","+    public void withJsonNodeOk() throws Exception","+    {","+        final ObjectMapper defaultingMapper = jsonMapperBuilder()","+                .activateDefaultTyping(BasicPolymorphicTypeValidator.builder()","+                        .allowSubTypesWithExplicitDeserializer()","+                        .build(),","+                        DefaultTyping.NON_FINAL)","+                .build();","+","+        ObjectNode node = defaultingMapper.createObjectNode();","+        node.put(\"x\", 1);","+        String json = defaultingMapper.writeValueAsString(new ObjectWrapper(node));","+        ObjectWrapper result = defaultingMapper.readValue(json, ObjectWrapper.class);","+        assertEquals(node, result.value);","+    }"," }",""